{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Sparkle Pro 是一款把建立每日習慣變得有趣又有回報的 App，適合想養成規律運動、閱讀或飲水習慣卻難以持之以恆的使用者。它以虛擬夥伴 Sparkle Buddy 陪伴你逐日累積成果，讓你更願意每天完成目標。此 App 原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費，可於 App Store 下載。</p>\n\n<h2>一鍵打卡與夥伴成長</h2>\n<p>開啟 App 即可一鍵完成每日打卡，同時查看目前與最長連續天數，內置喝水、運動、閱讀等快速範本。虛擬夥伴 Sparkle Buddy 會隨打卡累積 XP 並升級，心情亦隨你的穩定程度變化；連續紀錄中斷時，Spark Saver 提供一次免費修復，之後可用打卡賺取的遊戲金幣補回。所有資料只儲存在裝置上。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-220-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-221-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-222-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-223-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-224-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Sparkle Pro</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-13T04:19:31.173183+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":358,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-13T04:06:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-13T04:37:48.789950+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-13T04:17:39.546536+00:00","content_hash":"8500f0266ebc2b256e83cc4bdaae19bd528a73e568ee772fc6285c3bdb11d615","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}